[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-exchange 6...e6"]
[Name "Exchange: 7.h3"]

7. h3 { White asks the question a move early. }
7... Bxf3 { The same answer: take the knight that guards d4 rather than be pushed around. }
8. Bxf3 Nc6 { Develops with a second look at d4; the bishop on f3 cannot help guard that pawn. }
9. O-O { The main line's position by another order: ...Bd6 comes next. } *
